        ["Profiles.MissingSettingsTitle"] = "Missing settings",
        ["HighWarning.Title"] = "IMPORTANT",
        ["HighWarning.BodyTop"] = "Hi, congrats, you’ve chosen preset HIGH, also known by me as the \"I’ll burn your house down\" preset!\n\nThe HIGH preset uses DLAA, while War Thunder normally defaults to DLSS. NVIDIA users should use NVIDIA Profile Inspector and apply the settings shown below.\nOnce done, press Apply Changes inside NVIDIA Profile Inspector.",
        ["HighWarning.BodyRight"] = "This only applies if you’re using an NVIDIA GPU.\n\nIf you’re using another type of GPU, switch Anti-Aliasing to TSR.\n\nIf you’re not happy with the result, turn anti-aliasing OFF completely for much smoother performance.\n\nAfter changing settings, create a custom profile so your tuned settings are not lost when switching presets.",
